#X text 30 240 pad 41 -> ch1 only          = STATIC red;
#X text 30 260 pad 43 -> ch1 red + ch2 green = FLASHING between them;
#X text 30 280 pad 45 -> ch3 only          = PULSING blue;
#X text 30 320 Launchpad lighting modes are MIDI channels 1/2/3.;
#X text 30 340 Flashing alternates the ch1 and ch2 colours for that pad.;
#X text 30 360 Pulsing ramps the ch3 colour up and down.;
